  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assitance to the Shipping Association of Jamaica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global objective:&lt;/strong&gt; To improve the general competitiveness of Newport West as a Logistics Hub&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective&lt;/strong&gt;:  To support the Shipping Association of Jamaica in:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.Drafting the terms of reference and estimating associated budgets for the feasibility studies, designs and procurement of: (i) the Drainage and (ii) Road projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.Launching the tendering and monitoring the implementation of the feasibility studies, designs and procurement of the Works contract for the Drainage only.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3 Setting up and negotiate a PPP convenient to the SAJ and all stakeholders for the Drainage only&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
